[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0537","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0537.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-48881","title":"Linux Kernel bcache 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 bcache 子系统中存在空指针解引用漏洞。提交 028ddcac477b 移除了节点分配中的 NULL 指针检查，将 IS_ERR_OR_NULL 替换为 IS_ERR，导致在 cache_set_flush() 函数中，当 c->root 因注册流程失败而为 NULL 时，代码仍尝试访问其成员，引发空指针解引用，造成系统崩溃。本地攻击者需具备低权限即可触发此漏洞，影响系统可用性。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-48881"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:23Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:58:57Z","remediation":"更新 Linux 内核至包含提交 028ddcac477b 回退补丁的版本（主线内核 ≥ 6.12，或各发行版已合入该修复的内核包）。Debian 11 用户升级至 linux 5.10.234-1 及以上版本（DLA-4075），Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户升级至 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency 6.11.0-1011.12~24.04.1 及以上版本（USN-7381-1）。如无法立即更新内核，可通过限制本地用户对 bcache 设备的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/336e30f32ae7c043fde0f6fa21586ff30bea9fe2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4379c5828492a4c2a651c8f826a01453bd2b80b0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5202391970ffbf81975251b3526b890ba027b715","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5e0e913624bcd24f3de414475018d3023f060ee1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b2e382ae12a63560fca35050498e19e760adf8c0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cc05aa2c0117e20fa25a3c0d915f98b8f2e78667","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fb5fee35bdd18316a84b5f30881a24e1415e1464","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-48881.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2024/48xxx/CVE-2024-48881.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-48881.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-48881","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-48881.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a538bd81432b918b342e413f43256da1f80b6c0d/2024/48xxx/CVE-2024-48881.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-48881.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f7fbdb78e572cf69166b06f5f222a65cac6edb53/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-48881-2025-11-03-1443","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-2g99-pch7-3284/GHSA-2g99-pch7-3284.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-48881"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0537.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0536","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0536.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-48875","title":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统死锁漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统在 dev_replace 设备替换功能中存在死锁漏洞（CWE-667）。当启用 RAID stripe-tree 功能并执行设备替换操作时，btrfs_map_block 函数会尝试重复获取同一个 dev_replace rwsem 读写信号量，导致任务在已持有该锁的情况下再次请求锁，触发 lockdep 检测到的递归锁定死锁。该漏洞影响启用了 RAID stripe-tree 特性的 Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统，CVSS 3.1 评分 5.5（中等），攻击向量为本地（AV:L），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），需要低权限（PR:L），无需用户交互（UI:N），主要影响可用性（A:H）。本地攻击者可通过触发带有 RAID stripe-tree 的 btrfs 设备替换操作（如运行 fstests btrfs/011 测试），导致内核死锁引发拒绝服务。Linux 内核已通过修改 btrfs_map_block 避免在已持有 dev_replace rwsem 的任务中再次获取该锁来修复此死锁问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-48875"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:58:56Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.11.5、6.10.13、6.6.48、6.1.106 或 5.15.166 及以上版本（含修复提交 7a5c5b8b3b2f）。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7381-1/USN-7450-1 安全更新（linux-image-6.8.0-49-generic 及以上）。如暂时无法升级内核，可临时避免在使用 RAID stripe-tree 特性的 btrfs 文件系统上执行设备替换操作，或在维护窗口卸载相关文件系统后再执行替换操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8cca35cb29f81eba3e96ec44dad8696c8a2f9138","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a2e99dcd7aafa9d474f7d9b0740b8f93c4e156c2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2024/48xxx/CVE-2024-48875.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-48875","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a538bd81432b918b342e413f43256da1f80b6c0d/2024/48xxx/CVE-2024-48875.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-48875.yaml","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-48875.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-48875.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-48875-btrfs-dont-take-dev-replace-rwsem-o-1771412274000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-hg9v-mfmx-jx2x/GHSA-hg9v-mfmx-jx2x.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-48875","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-48875.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0536.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0535","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0535.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-48873","title":"Linux Kernel rtw89 无线驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 rtw89 无线网卡驱动在处理 RNR（Reduced Neighbor Report）时存在空指针解引用漏洞。函数 `ieee80211_probereq_get()` 在特定条件下可能返回 NULL，但调用方未检查其返回值便直接使用，导致空指针访问。本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞触发内核崩溃，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 rtw89 驱动的 Realtek 无线网卡设备，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-48873"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:58:56Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.66、6.12.5 或 6.13 及以上版本，包含提交 630d5d8f2bf6、7296e5611adb 或 1a0f54cb3fea 的补丁。各发行版用户可通过包管理器更新内核包（如 Ubuntu 运行 apt update && apt upgrade linux-image-generic），更新后重启系统生效。无法立即升级时，可卸载 rtw89 内核模块（modprobe -r rtw89_pci rtw89_core）禁用 Realtek WiFi 驱动作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1a0f54cb3fea5d087440b2bae03202c445156a8d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/630d5d8f2bf6b340202b6bc2c05d794bbd8e4c1c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7296e5611adb2c619bd7bd3817ddde7ba865ef17","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2024/48xxx/CVE-2024-48873.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-48873.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a538bd81432b918b342e413f43256da1f80b6c0d/2024/48xxx/CVE-2024-48873.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-48873","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-48873.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-48873.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-qvj7-hg6c-8g8h/GHSA-qvj7-hg6c-8g8h.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-48873","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-48873.json","https://github.com/equinixmetal-images/changelog/blob/43c481d19f0a015611a5309a435c9b590b5b5bc2/flatcar/flatcar_stable.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0535.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0532","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0532.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-47809","title":"Linux Kernel DLM 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DLM（分布式锁管理器）子系统中存在空指针解引用漏洞。当从 request_lock() 函数调用时，由于 lkb->lkb_resource 尚未通过 attach_lkb() 完成资源分配，在特定日志输出路径下可能触发空指针解引用，导致系统崩溃（拒绝服务）。该漏洞需本地低权限用户触发，影响系统可用性，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-47809"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:22Z","updated":"2026-07-14T13:17:10Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下安全版本：5.15.209 及以上、6.1.167 及以上、6.6.66 及以上、6.12.5 及以上，或直接升级至 6.13 主线版本。对应补丁提交为 2db11504ef82、6fbdc3980b70、b98333c67daf、8d55ce46dd54、e1ffea6bec96。Siemens SIMATIC S7-1500 MFP 系列用户请参考 Siemens 安全公告 SSA-019113 和 SSA-082556 更新固件。如无法立即升级，可禁用 DLM 内核模块（modprobe -r dlm）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2db11504ef82a60c1a2063ba7431a5cd013ecfcb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6fbdc3980b70e9c1c86eccea7d5ee68108008fa7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8d55ce46dd543c6965970ce70c22c3076dd35b1e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b98333c67daf887c724cd692e88e2db9418c0861","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e1ffea6bec96d4349dbfcc42ad3e436259f64243","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-019113.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-082556.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-47809.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47809.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-47809.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-47809","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a538bd81432b918b342e413f43256da1f80b6c0d/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47809.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-47809.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-9fhm-w5m6-rqv5/GHSA-9fhm-w5m6-rqv5.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-47809","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-47809.json","https://github.com/equinixmetal-images/changelog/blob/43c481d19f0a015611a5309a435c9b590b5b5bc2/flatcar/flatcar_stable.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0532.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0531","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0531.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-47794","title":"Linux Kernel BPF 尾调用无限循环拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 BPF 子系统中存在一个由 freplace 程序与尾调用（tailcall）组合引发的无限循环漏洞。当 entry_freplace 的附加目标为 subprog_tc，而尾调用又指向 entry_tc 时，会形成 entry_tc → subprog_tc → entry_freplace → tailcall → entry_tc 的死循环。由于每次执行 entry_freplace 时 tail_call_cnt 计数器都会重置为零，尾调用机制无法终止，最终导致内核崩溃（kernel panic）。本地攻击者只需低权限即可触发此漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-47794"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:57:45Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.12.5 或更高版本（主线内核已包含修复提交 987aa730bad3 和 d6083f040d5d）。各发行版用户请安装对应安全更新：Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 安装 USN-7381-1 或 USN-7450-1 更新，SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP6 安装 SUSE-SU-2025:1177-1 更新。如无法立即升级，可通过 seccomp 限制 BPF 系统调用（禁用 bpf() 和 BPF_PROG_TYPE_EXT 相关操作）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/987aa730bad3e1ef66d9f30182294daa78f6387d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d6083f040d5d8f8d748462c77e90547097df936e","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47794.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-47794.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-47794","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-47794.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-47794.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-47794.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-47794-bpf-prevent-tailcall-infinite-loop--1767883860000.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-47794.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-qrrc-56f8-gw3j/GHSA-qrrc-56f8-gw3j.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-47794"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0531.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0527","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0527.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-47141","title":"Linux Kernel pinmux 竞争条件空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 pinmux 子系统中存在竞争条件漏洞，当两个进程同时对同一 GPIO 引脚调用 pinctrl_select_state() 时，由于对 desc->mux_owner 的访问缺乏互斥保护，一个进程更新 desc->mux_usecount 后尚未设置 mux_owner，另一进程检测到 usecount 非零后访问空指针 mux_owner 进行 strcmp 比较，导致空指针解引用引发内核崩溃。本地攻击者可通过低权限账户并发触发该条件造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。Linux 内核社区已通过引入互斥锁序列化 mux 相关设置访问修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-47141"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:21Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:56:37Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 6.6.66、6.12.5 或 6.13 及以上版本，该漏洞已通过提交 2da32aed4a97 修复。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户可安装 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency（USN-7381-1）或 linux-image-6.8.0-1028-gcp（USN-7450-1）并重启系统。如无法立即升级，可限制本地用户对 GPIO/pinctrl 设备的访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2da32aed4a97ca1d70fb8b77926f72f30ce5fb4b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5a3e85c3c397c781393ea5fb2f45b1f60f8a4e6e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c11e2ec9a780f54982a187ee10ffd1b810715c85","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47141.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-47141.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47141.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-47141","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-47141.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-47141.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-ff75-3hc4-j344/GHSA-ff75-3hc4-j344.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-47141","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-47141.json","https://github.com/equinixmetal-images/changelog/blob/43c481d19f0a015611a5309a435c9b590b5b5bc2/flatcar/flatcar_stable.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0527.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0524","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0524.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45828","title":"Linux Kernel i3c mipi-i3c-hci 驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 MIPI I3C HCI 驱动在 DMA 模式下存在空指针解引用漏洞。在总线清理过程中，当停止 DMA 环时可能触发 RING_OP_STAT 中断，由于环停止请求完成、中断处理程序移除与代码执行之间存在竞态条件，中断处理函数 hci_dma_irq_handler() 可能在 io_data 指针已被 hci_dma_cleanup() 置空后继续执行，导致空指针解引用，造成系统崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞发起拒绝服务攻击。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45828"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:21Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:54:53Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至修复版本：Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 安装 USN-7381-1 或 USN-7450-1 更新（`apt update && apt upgrade`），其他发行版升级内核至包含 commit `mask ring interrupts before ring stop request` 的版本（主线内核 ≥ v6.12-rc4 或对应 LTS 稳定分支）。如无法立即更新，可卸载或黑名单禁用 `mipi-i3c-hci` 内核模块（`echo \"blacklist mipi_i3c_hci\" > /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-i3c.conf`）作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/19cc5767334bfe980f52421627d0826c0da86721","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6ca2738174e4ee44edb2ab2d86ce74f015a0cc32","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9d745a56aea45e47f4755bc12e6429d6314dbb54","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a6cddf68b3405b272b5a3cad9657be0b02b34bf4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a6dc4b4fda2e147e557050eaae51ff15edeb680b","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-45828.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45828.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-45828.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-45828","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45828.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-45828.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/9c21390c1b52354f2bcded00c6f9b47d11852fe2/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-45828-2025-11-03-1432","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-45828.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-qrf2-8jcf-fv7v/GHSA-qrf2-8jcf-fv7v.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-45828"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0524.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0509","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0509.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-43098","title":"Linux Kernel i3c 递归锁导致死锁漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 i3c 子系统存在死锁漏洞，i3c_master_register() 函数在注册 i3c 设备时重复获取 i3cbus->lock 锁，导致递归加锁引发内核死锁。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞触发系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。开发者已通过直接使用 i3cdev->desc->info 替代重复调用 i3c_device_get_info() 的方式修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-43098"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:21Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:50:26Z","remediation":"及时将 Linux 内核升级至以下已修复版本：5.4.287、5.10.231、5.15.174、6.1.120、6.6.66 或 6.12.5 及更高版本。补丁已合入主线及 LTS 分支，可通过 `git cherry-pick` 应用内核仓库中的 7 个对应提交。如无法升级内核，可禁用 CONFIG_I3C 内核选项，或在系统启动时通过内核参数 `i3c.disable=1` 关闭 i3c 驱动避免触发死锁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1f51ae217d09c361ede900b94735a6d2df6c0344","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2d98fa2a50b8058de52ada168fa5dbabb574711b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5ac1dd51aaa0ce8b5421d1137e857955a4b6f55e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6cf7b65f7029914dc0cd7db86fac9ee5159008c6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/816187b1833908941286e71b0041059a4acd52ed","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9a2173660ee53d5699744f02e6ab7bf89fcd0b1a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ffe19e363c6f8b992ba835a361542568dea17409","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-43098.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2024/43xxx/CVE-2024-43098.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-43098","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-43098.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c82f217443f5e10c0c4e9bda1118e45073d229ba/2024/43xxx/CVE-2024-43098.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-43098.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/891e02cb95ef463730509df70a6ab47638098a75/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-43098-2025-11-03-1432","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-43098.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-g6f8-f8f2-6wh5/GHSA-g6f8-f8f2-6wh5.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-43098"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0509.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0507","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0507.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-41935","title":"Linux Kernel f2fs 读取范围节点批量缩小拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 f2fs 文件系统在收缩 extent tree（读取范围树）时，使用读写锁（rwlock）保护核心结构数据。当 extent tree 中存在大量 extent node 时，收缩过程会长时间持有该读写锁，导致内核挂起（kernel hang），形成拒绝服务（DoS）漏洞。本地攻击者可通过触发 f2fs 文件系统大量 extent node 的创建与收缩操作来利用此漏洞。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各版本，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-41935"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:21Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:48:28Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.66、6.12.5 或 6.13 及以上版本，其中已合入批量收缩 extent 节点读写锁持有时间的修复补丁。如无法立即升级，可通过内核参数 `mitigations=auto` 启用内核默认缓解机制，并避免在 f2fs 文件系统上执行大量文件删除/截断操作以减少 extent 树收缩触发频率。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/295b50e95e900da31ff237e46e04525fa799b2cf","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3fc5d5a182f6a1f8bd4dc775feb54c369dd2c343","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/924f7dd1e832e4e4530d14711db223d2803f7b61","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2024/41xxx/CVE-2024-41935.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-41935.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-41935","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-41935.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-41935.js