396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-41932.yaml","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2024-41932.md","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-41932","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-41932.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-41932.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-41932-sched-fix-warning-in-sched-setaffin-1767883750000.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-41932.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-r78q-c787-rf79/GHSA-r78q-c787-rf79.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-41932"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0506.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0528","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0528.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-47143","title":"Linux Kernel dma-debug radix_lock 死锁漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 dma-debug 子系统在操作 radix_lock 时存在死锁漏洞。当多个 CPU 核心并发执行 DMA 调试操作时，radix_lock 的获取顺序不当可能导致死锁，造成系统无响应或拒绝服务。本地攻击者可通过精心构造的 DMA 操作序列触发该条件，导致内核崩溃。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，Red Hat 评估为低危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-47143"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-01-11T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Linux 内核升级至以下安全版本：5.10.231、5.15.174、6.1.120、6.6.66、6.12.5 或 6.13 及以上版本。对于无法立即升级内核的系统，可通过禁用 DMA 调试功能（内核启动参数中移除 `dma_debug=1` 或设置 `dma_debug=0`）作为临时缓解措施，但请注意这将影响 DMA 相关问题的调试能力。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-47143.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47143.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-47143.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-47143","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47143.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ad05f692bdc2a0af2a34a2775ccc3bbb8c03507e/2024/CVE-2024-47143.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-47143.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/9c21390c1b52354f2bcded00c6f9b47d11852fe2/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-47143-2025-11-03-1442","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-g29r-ch4v-q6cx/GHSA-g29r-ch4v-q6cx.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-47143"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0528.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0503","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0503.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-37372","title":"Node.js Permission Model 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Node.js 权限模型（Permission Model）在处理以双反斜杠 `\\\\` 开头的路径时存在路径遍历漏洞。该模型错误地假设此类路径的前 4 个字符（即 `\\\\?\\` 前缀）可被安全忽略，但实际并非总是如此，导致权限检查与真实文件访问路径不一致。攻击者可通过构造特制的 UNC 路径绕过权限模型的路径限制，实现对受限文件系统的越权访问。该漏洞影响 Node.js 22.x 及 20.x 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 3.6，危害等级低，但可被用于绕过安全沙箱机制。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2024-37372"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-09T01:15:08Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:38:14Z","remediation":"建议升级 Node.js 至 v20.15.1 或 v22.4.1 及以上版本（2024年7月安全更新），该漏洞仅影响 Windows 平台的权限模型。如无法立即升级，可暂时禁用实验性权限模型（移除 --experimental-permission-model 启动参数）作为临时缓解措施，或避免在权限模型下使用 UNC 路径（以 \\\\ 开头的路径）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2024/07/11/6","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2024/07/19/3","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250502-0010/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-37372.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2024/37xxx/CVE-2024-37372.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/c723932b6cef36d7df29b07fee2ccc4a2e5a8288/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-37372.json","https://github.com/nodejs/nodejs.org/blob/2275f25939126c3b62ef0cbe8c522b606d712422/apps/site/pages/en/blog/release/v22.4.1.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/5783c4faface106006c789980893e0fe9b303ad9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-37372","https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/f57e06c0c7b224221d0799ea8cea7dd8215a9a29/osv/node/CVE-2024-37372.json.sha512","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c82f217443f5e10c0c4e9bda1118e45073d229ba/2024/37xxx/CVE-2024-37372.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/891e02cb95ef463730509df70a6ab47638098a75/references/CVE-2024-37372-2025-05-02-2205","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/72f2dfae7109a1c22fada87801e672e993ae2d77/main/nodejs/APKBUILD","https://github.com/ossf/alpha-omega/blob/6d5e72ef1df596b4fc89a6c4b38bf1abe07d19a2/alpha/engagements/2024/NodeJS/update-2024-june-july.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0503.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0590","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0590.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56787","title":"Linux kernel i.MX8M SoC 驱动异步探测导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 i.MX8M Plus SoC 驱动存在初始化顺序缺陷，当内核命令行启用 driver_async_probe=* 参数时，soc-imx8m.c 驱动在时钟驱动尚未完成探测前调用 of_clk_get_by_name() 获取时钟信息，导致返回 -EPROBE_DEFER 错误并触发内核警告栈回溯。本地攻击者可通过设置特定内核引导参数触发该竞态条件，造成系统可用性受影响。该漏洞影响 i.MX8M Plus 平台上的 Linux 内核，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。修复方式是将 SoC 代码转换为平台驱动并实现 probe 重试机制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56787"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T18:15:19Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:59Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 5.15.174、6.1.120、6.6.66 或 6.12.5 及以上版本，对应提交为 2129f6faa5df 等。Debian 用户可运行 apt update && apt upgrade 安装 USN-7381-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级，避免在内核命令行使用 driver_async_probe=* 参数作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2129f6faa5dfe8c6b87aad11720bf75edd77d3e4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/997a3c04d7fa3d1d385c14691350d096fada648c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9cc832d37799dbea950c4c8a34721b02b8b5a8ff","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e497edb8f31ec2c2b6f4ce930e175aa2da8be334","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ea2ff66feb5f9b183f9e2f9d06c21340bd88de12","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56787.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56787.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56787","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56787.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56787.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56787.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56787-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56787.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-m6c8-mv97-5jcm/GHSA-m6c8-mv97-5jcm.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56787"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0590.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0589","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0589.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56786","title":"Linux Kernel BPF 链接安全释放漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 BPF 子系统存在 bpf_link 生命周期管理缺陷，当 BPF 链接可以被安全释放时，未能正确放置关联的 BPF 程序，可能导致释放后使用（Use-After-Free）或引用计数错误。本地具有低权限的攻击者可通过加载特制 BPF 程序触发此漏洞，造成系统崩溃或权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核相关版本，但该 CVE 编号已被 Linux CNA 官方驳回，建议参考对应内核补丁进行修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56786"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T18:15:19Z","updated":"2025-06-19T13:15:46Z","remediation":"建议立即更新 Linux 内核至包含修复的版本：RHEL 9 用户升级至 kernel-5.14.0-611.5.1.el9_7（RHSA-2025:20518），Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户升级至 linux-image-6.11.0-1011.12~24.04.1（USN-7381-1），其他发行版更新至主线内核 6.13 及以上版本。更新完成后须重启系统生效。如无法立即更新，可通过限制非特权用户加载 BPF 程序作为临时缓解措施：设置 kernel.unprivileged_bpf_disabled=1。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56786.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56786.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56786.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56786.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56786","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56786.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56786.md","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2024-56786","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-56786.json","https://github.com/InfoSecREDD/CVE-Discord-Notify/blob/3f4b2b159624fda9a5cd9efcc2a46893068cd4db/seen_cves.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0589.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0588","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0588.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56785","title":"Linux Kernel MIPS Loongson64 DTS PCIe 设备树配置缺陷导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核中 MIPS 架构龙芯 64 平台（Loongson64）的设备树（DTS）存在 PCIe 端口节点配置缺陷，ls7a 芯片组的设备树源文件中缺少必要的 `#address-cells` 属性且中断控制器配置不当，导致内核在解析设备树时触发运行时警告及中断映射失败。本地攻击者可通过加载特制的设备树或利用系统启动过程中的设备树解析流程触发该漏洞，造成内核告警泛滥及系统可用性受影响。该漏洞影响使用龙芯 64 处理器及 ls7a 芯片组的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。Linux 内核主线已通过提交 d89a415ff8d5 修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56785"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T18:15:19Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:59Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至包含 commit d89a415ff8d5 及后续修复的版本（主线内核 >= 6.12）。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户可通过 `sudo apt update && sudo apt install linux-image-6.8.0-1028-gcp`（GCP 实例）或对应发行版的最新内核包修复；其他发行版用户应更新至包含该补丁的内核版本。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用受影响硬件平台（Loongson64）的 PCIe 热插拔功能作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_